    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d433">

                <pb facs="0594" n="488" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg488"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Carr to Mr.
                            Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                            1891</hi>.</date> (Received September 28.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 55.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my two dispatches Nos. 52 and
                    53, and to my telegram of the 8th instant concerning the removal of the
                    prohibition of the importation of American pork into Denmark, I have the honor
                    to inclose herewith a translation of the decree of his excellency the minister
                    of the interior by which the prohibition was removed.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark E. Carr</hi>.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d433-a1.xml" xpointer="d433-a1"/>
